<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Mecial started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FPA Mecial started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said Wednesday analyst Joe France had started coverage of FPA Medical Management Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Diego company opened down 7/16 at 18-15/16.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
